<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SCORERS IN SPANISH LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCORERS IN SPANISH LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the Spanish</p>
<p>league championship after Sunday's matches:</p>
<p>34 - Ronaldo (Barcelona)</p>
<p>25 - Alfonso Perez (Real Betis)</p>
<p>22 - Davor Suker (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>21 - Rivaldo (Deportiva Coruna)</p>
<p>19 - Oli Alvarez (Oviedo); Raul Gonzalez (Real Madrid)</p>
